flowchart TD
  User[Authenticated user] --> Gateway[Gateway verified context]
  Gateway --> Orchestrator[AI Orchestrator]
  Orchestrator --> Core[Core policy: Knowledge capability]
  Orchestrator --> Knowledge[Knowledge secure retrieval\non behalf of requester]
  Knowledge --> ACL[Core membership + Knowledge ACL scope]
  ACL --> Evidence[Authorized evidence only]
  Evidence --> Context[Bounded context builder\nE1 E2 ...]
  Context --> Provider[Generation provider]
  Provider --> Output[Structured answer + evidence IDs]
  Output --> Citations[Citation validator\nserver-owned provenance]
  Citations --> Answer[Grounded answer + citations]

  Orchestrator -. forbidden .-> DirectDb[(Knowledge PostgreSQL)]
  Orchestrator -. forbidden .-> Pgvector[(Direct pgvector query)]

  Orchestrator --> KnowledgeTool[Knowledge tool: implemented]
  Orchestrator -. future .-> AnalyticsTool[Data Analytics tool: future]
